{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年73歲「獎門人」曾志偉卸任總經理（節目內容營運）一職，轉任諮詢委員會召集人後，不時與友人遊山玩水，周遊列國，內地香港兩地人緣極佳。近來他常隨明星足球隊北上作賽招呼朋友，日前更豪氣包5枱請明星足球隊成員食飯，相當有面！</p><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉自卸下無綫（TVB）總經理職位後，生活過得相當愜意。(葉志明攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260426/1125131176235765760935640.jpeg/8gRVCwzv-4xpDO_kiSrlnORxjeOsj8i2aszssmrM7LI\"/><figcaption>曾志偉自卸下無綫（TVB）總經理職位後，生活過得相當愜意。(葉志明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>曾志偉豪包5圍枱請食飯</p><p>日前曾志偉北上到衡陽應酬，與餐廳老闆食飯。曾志偉在席間大讚好味，並指在香港開分店都完全無問題。曾志偉因為喜歡衡陽菜，更豪氣包下5圍枱並說道：「先5桌，領導來就6桌！」談及安保問題，他指：「安保包在我身上！」隨後曾志偉帶明星足球隊成員幫襯餐廳，坐在一旁的鄧兆尊比出V字手勢激讚附和曾志偉，又型又威！</p><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉包5圍枱請明星足球隊食飯。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266343832195072359264.jpeg/saxo5BfB8KE4Wdw5__AI2h7lf3bC1ajYf7nt5X-57eU\"/><figcaption>曾志偉包5圍枱請明星足球隊食飯。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好識應酬。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266360127590400178653.jpeg/ajeS2xIC5hRJON8vpfx-5Em0_FgN7g_HP2rrED9q6xA\"/><figcaption>好識應酬。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉帶了一大班圈中好友到場。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266357766066176036491.jpeg/O3qYf-nXg81RNQZX3gVU8aYi2yreC5hg1ik8v9YpPL8\"/><figcaption>曾志偉帶了一大班圈中好友到場。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉好威！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266355362598912914085.jpeg/ZkAnhchsmhax4nHAj5iry5XFY1Dd5xBzDc2Arw3NgK8\"/><figcaption>曾志偉好威！（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場好多人。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266352896217088732840.jpeg/yUimHY97lkjlVmf_TYaaisu9JC5bu4tCoPBrzaDwa80\"/><figcaption>現場好多人。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉激讚好食。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201266350324977664679038.jpeg/CZ9o_CyVE0N6BedWU5E4f9FUhsu7mnP80ekTytHpE8o\"/><figcaption>曾志偉激讚好食。（抖音）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T22:44:12.480768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:57:28.393340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T22:37:38.637870+00:00","content_hash":"3ac2164fa4c2df8b7b32bdc85729a5e930fed3368db812608db0a571363d391a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}